~ start
Nurse: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], What have you come here to do?
- Fix Me Up
	Nurse: Let us make you feel better this instant. 
	$> Global.open_link("https://youtu.be/da3Mw1ab7h4?si=o8CC9sQyw5JGkB8O&t=1")
	$> Global.action=""
- Donate Blood [if Global.can_donate_blood /]
	Nurse: Very well, come to the blood donation facility
	$> Global.action="Donate Blood"
- I yearn for a battle! [if Global.combat_unlocked and !("Mongolian Death Worm" in Global.enemies_defeated) /]=> END
	Nurse: Prepared to battle with the mongolian death worm?
	Nurse: Didn't think so. 
	Nurse: oh well, here ya go :)
	$> Global.pre_combat_scene="res://location_scenes/Riga/Hospital/Waiting Room.tscn"
	$> Global.start_combat(["Mongolian Death Worm"])
=> END